{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b> Taste </b> — from the root טעמו; this is the seeing of the heart." "<b> and see </b> — the seeing of the eye."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {0 "The lemma 'טעמו' (taste) in Psalms 34:9 is vocalized identically to the root form 'טעמו' (they tasted); Ibn Ezra plays on both the word and its root."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:27.374635154Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}